  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Capacity Toward Sustainable Intensification of Oilseed Crops in Iran addressing the Soybean Value Chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effectively integrated into the research for development programs along five crop value chains. Soybean improvement will be emphasized as a component of cereal-based production through capacity-building along with enhanced coordination among stakeholders; prominence is also on development of an investment-grade (UTF) program to enable scaling of farmer adoption and to address needs for enhancing other oilseed crops .</narrative>
  </description>
